{"id":"Y0pdQU87dc8","title":"(Everything I Do) I Do It for You","cues":[{"start":15.8,"duration":3.61,"en":"Look into my eyes","zh":"看著我的眼睛","text":"Look into my eyes"},{"start":19.46,"duration":2.73,"en":"You will see","zh":"你會看到","text":"You will see"},{"start":22.24,"duration":6.1,"en":"What you mean to me","zh":"你對我有多重要","text":"What you mean to me"},{"start":28.39,"duration":3.55,"en":"Search your heart","zh":"搜尋你的心臟","text":"Search your heart"},{"start":31.99,"duration":3.99,"en":"Search your soul","zh":"搜尋你的靈魂","text":"Search your soul"},{"start":36.03,"duration":3.42,"en":"And when you find me there","zh":"當你發現我在那裡","text":"And when you find me there"},{"start":39.5,"duration":4.21,"en":"You'll search no more","zh":"您無需再搜尋","text":"You'll search no more"},{"start":43.76,"duration":6.5,"en":"Don't tell me it's not worth tryin' for","zh":"別告訴我這不值得嘗試","text":"Don't tell me it's not worth tryin' for"},{"start":50.79,"duration":6.5,"en":"You can't tell me it's not worth dyin' for","zh":"你不能告訴我這不值得為之犧牲","text":"You can't tell me it's not worth dyin' for"},{"start":57.77,"duration":3.57,"en":"You know it's true","zh":"你知道這是真的","text":"You know it's true"},{"start":61.39,"duration":3.3,"en":"Everything I do","zh":"我所做的一切","text":"Everything I do"},{"start":64.74,"duration":6.5,"en":"I do it for you","zh":"我為你而做","text":"I do it for you"},{"start":74.3,"duration":3.36,"en":"Look into your heart","zh":"深入瞭解你的內心","text":"Look into your heart"},{"start":77.71,"duration":2.63,"en":"You will find","zh":"您會發現","text":"You will find"},{"start":80.39,"duration":6.47,"en":"There's nothin' there to hide","zh":"沒甚麼好躲的","text":"There's nothin' there to hide"},{"start":86.91,"duration":3.06,"en":"Take me as I am","zh":"接受我現在的樣子","text":"Take me as I am"},{"start":90.02,"duration":4.73,"en":"Take my life","zh":"奪走我的生命","text":"Take my life"},{"start":94.8,"duration":3.18,"en":"I would give it all","zh":"我會全力以赴","text":"I would give it all"},{"start":98.03,"duration":3.98,"en":"I would sacrifice","zh":"我會犧牲","text":"I would sacrifice"},{"start":102.06,"duration":6.5,"en":"Don't tell me it's not worth fightin' for","zh":"別告訴我這不值得為之奮鬥","text":"Don't tell me it's not worth fightin' for"},{"start":109.2,"duration":6.5,"en":"I can't help it there's nothin' I want more","zh":"我情不自禁，什麼都沒有，我想要更多","text":"I can't help it there's nothin' I want more"},{"start":116.02,"duration":3.85,"en":"You know it's true","zh":"你知道這是真的","text":"You know it's true"},{"start":119.92,"duration":3.58,"en":"Everything I do","zh":"我所做的一切","text":"Everything I do"},{"start":123.55,"duration":6.5,"en":"I do it for you","zh":"我為你而做","text":"I do it for you"},{"start":131.12,"duration":3.39,"en":"There's no love","zh":"沒有愛","text":"There's no love"},{"start":134.56,"duration":3.59,"en":"Like your love","zh":"喜歡你的愛","text":"Like your love"},{"start":138.2,"duration":3.74,"en":"And no other","zh":"沒有其他","text":"And no other"},{"start":141.99,"duration":3.61,"en":"Could give more love","zh":"可以給予更多的愛","text":"Could give more love"},{"start":145.65,"duration":3.68,"en":"There's nowhere","zh":"哪裡也沒有","text":"There's nowhere"},{"start":149.38,"duration":3.56,"en":"Unless you're there","zh":"除非你在場","text":"Unless you're there"},{"start":152.99,"duration":3.62,"en":"All the time","zh":"一直","text":"All the time"},{"start":156.66,"duration":6.5,"en":"All the way, yeah","zh":"一路上，是的","text":"All the way, yeah"},{"start":173.15,"duration":6.5,"en":"Look into your heart, baby","zh":"看看你的心，寶貝","text":"Look into your heart, baby"},{"start":192.94,"duration":6.5,"en":"Oh you can't tell me it's not worth tryin' for","zh":"哦，你不能告訴我這不值得嘗試","text":"Oh you can't tell me it's not worth tryin' for"},{"start":200.54,"duration":6.5,"en":"I can't help it there's nothin' I want more","zh":"我情不自禁，什麼都沒有，我想要更多","text":"I can't help it there's nothin' I want more"},{"start":207.54,"duration":4.19,"en":"Yeah, I would fight for you","zh":"對，我會為你而戰","text":"Yeah, I would fight for you"},{"start":211.78,"duration":3.21,"en":"I lie for you","zh":"我為你撒謊","text":"I lie for you"},{"start":215.04,"duration":3.42,"en":"Walk the wire for you","zh":"為你隨心所欲","text":"Walk the wire for you"},{"start":218.51,"duration":6.5,"en":"Yeah, I'd die for you","zh":"對，我願意為你而死","text":"Yeah, I'd die for you"},{"start":226.17,"duration":3.4,"en":"You know it's true","zh":"你知道這是真的","text":"You know it's true"},{"start":229.62,"duration":3.65,"en":"Everything I do","zh":"我所做的一切","text":"Everything I do"},{"start":233.32,"duration":3.77,"en":"Oh","zh":"哦","text":"Oh"},{"start":237.14,"duration":6.5,"en":"I do it for you","zh":"我為你而做","text":"I do it for you"},{"start":257.17,"duration":6.5,"en":"Everything I do, darling","zh":"我所做的一切，親愛的","text":"Everything I do, darling"},{"start":264.68,"duration":4.46,"en":"Yeah we'll see it through","zh":"對，我們會全力以赴","text":"Yeah we'll see it through"},{"start":269.19,"duration":5.95,"en":"Well we'll see it though, oh yeah","zh":"好吧，我們會看到的，哦，耶","text":"Well we'll see it though, oh yeah"},{"start":275.19,"duration":4.88,"en":"Yeah!","zh":"嗯","text":"Yeah!"},{"start":280.12,"duration":6.45,"en":"Search your heart and your soul","zh":"搜尋你的心靈和靈魂","text":"Search your heart and your soul"},{"start":286.62,"duration":6.5,"en":"You can't tell me it ain't worth dyin' for","zh":"你不能告訴我這不值得為之犧牲","text":"You can't tell me it ain't worth dyin' for"},{"start":297.58,"duration":6.5,"en":"I'll be there","zh":"我會去的","text":"I'll be there"},{"start":309.28,"duration":6.5,"en":"I'd walk the fire for you","zh":"我會為你縱火","text":"I'd walk the fire for you"},{"start":318.3,"duration":6.5,"en":"I'd die for you","zh":"我願意為你而死","text":"I'd die for you"},{"start":333.41,"duration":6.5,"en":"Oh, yeah","zh":"哦，耶","text":"Oh, yeah"},{"start":341.46,"duration":4.82,"en":"All the time","zh":"一直","text":"All the time"},{"start":346.33,"duration":4.0,"en":"I'm going all the way, all the way","zh":"我一路走，一路走","text":"I'm going all the way, all the way"}],"words":[],"en":["Look into my eyes","You 